modifier.demigod_armor.name=Demigod
modifier.demigod_armor.desc=Reduces incoming health loss by a configured percentage.
modifier.turtle_armor.name=Zeno's Turtle
modifier.turtle_armor.desc=Requires Demigod. Limits each health loss to a configured percentage of current health.
modifier.blossom_armor.name=Falling Blossom
modifier.blossom_armor.desc=Unbroken armor grants flat damage reduction based on maximum durability, stacking across pieces.
modifier.lifecontract_armor.name=Life Contract
modifier.lifecontract_armor.desc=Limits the player's current health (down to 1 at max level) and grants damage reduction based on modifier level.
modifier.gasmask_armor.name=Gas Mask
modifier.gasmask_armor.desc=Helmet only. Grants a chance per level to cancel incoming negative effects.
modifier.supergasmask_armor.name=Super Gas Mask
modifier.supergasmask_armor.desc=Helmet only. Completely cancels incoming negative effects.
modifier.counter.name=Counterstrike
modifier.counter.desc=When attacked, the held tool has a chance to automatically strike back at the attacker.
modifier.autoattack.name=Auto Attack
modifier.autoattack.desc=While holding left click, automatically attacks the target under the crosshair according to the tool's attack speed.
modifier.weaponmaster.name=Weapon Mastery
modifier.weaponmaster.desc=Projectiles from this ranged tool deal extra damage when they hit, gaining a portion of your melee attack damage per level.
modifier.multistrike.name=Multi Strike
modifier.multistrike.desc=Lodges in the target and strikes it repeatedly before flying on; the level sets how many targets are pierced, how long it lodges, and the extra hit count.
